  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Slice mini flour tortillas into wedges and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle or spray generously with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63363948ad6e96e9d70488cb/step-cb5e6140.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop tomato and cucumber. Grate carrot. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, combine tomato and cucumber. Add a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil and toss. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63363948ad6e96e9d70488cb/step-d36ab7e3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook carrot until softened, 3-4 mins. Stir in tomato paste, garlic and jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add red kidney beans (including liquid from tin) and the butter and cook, stirring, until softened, 3-4 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63363948ad6e96e9d70488cb/step-9dcb62a0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tortilla chips between bowls.\n• Top with Caribbean bean mixture and sour cream.\n• Serve with salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63363948ad6e96e9d70488cb/step-4ef2d97b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
